The Procurement Records module enables users to manage supply orders, track procurement expenses, allocate items to individuals or teams, and monitor order status.
4.4.1 Dashboard Summary
At the top of the page, summary cards display key procurement statistics:
•	Total BO (Number of supply orders)
•	Total Cost
