14.11 Settings
The Settings module allows users to manage their account credentials and view system-related information, including application details and version information.
 
Figure 32: Settings Page
4.11.1 Reset Password
The Reset Password section allows users to securely change their account password.
Users must:
•	Enter Current Password.
•	Enter New Password.
•	Re-enter New Password for confirmation.
•	Click Save Password.
Password requirements:
•	Minimum 8 characters
•	At least one special character
If the entered passwords do not match or do not meet requirements, validation messages are displayed. The system ensures secure password handling.
About the Tool
The About section provides a brief description of the application, explaining its purpose and functionality. It highlights:
•	Data analysis capabilities
